📄 Section 1: Executive Summary Report
Project Title
Automated Psychedelic Spoken-Word & Fractal Music Video Engine

Project Overview
This project is an automated content production engine designed to convert speech and interview clips (e.g., psychedelic, philosophical, or mind-expansion dialogue) into spoken-word musical tracks. It pairs the generated audio with zooming Mandelbrot fractal animations and dynamic AI art overlays, exporting publication-ready .mp4 video tracks.

The system runs at near-zero operational cost by combining local open-source AI models (for transcription, speaker diarization, and voice synthesis) with low-cost APIs (DeepSeek) and manual/automated Suno Pro music workflows.

